hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"35","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Mere aur meri khataon ke darmiyan duri kar de jaise mashriq aur maghrib ke darmiyan duri ki. Ae Allah! Mujhe meri khataon se pak kar de jaise safed kapda mail se pak kiya jata hai. Ae Allah! Mujhe meri khataon se barf, pani aur olon se dho de. [Namaz ki shuruati dua]"
"36","[AI-translation] Ae Allah, Tu pak hai; teri hi tareef hai; tera naam babarkat hai, teri azmat buland hai; tere siwa koi mabud nahin. [Namaz ki shuruati dua]"
"37","[AI-translation] Main ne apna chehra us ki taraf kar liya jis ne aasmanon aur zameen ko paida kiya, yaksu hokar; main mushrikon mein se nahin. Beshak meri namaz, meri qurbani, meri zindagi aur meri maut Allah Rabbul-aalamin ke liye hai, jis ka koi shareek nahin; isi ka mujhe hukm diya gaya hai aur main musalmanon mein se hun. Ae Allah! Tu hi Badshah hai; tere siwa koi mabud nahin; Tu hi mera Rab hai, main tera banda hun. Main ne apni jaan par zulm kiya, apne gunah ka iqrar kiya; mere sare gunah bakhsh de; tere siwa gunah koi nahin bakhshta. Mujhe behtareen akhlaq ki hidayat de; behtareen ki taraf tere siwa koi hidayat nahin deta. Us ki burai ko mujhse pher de; us ki burai ko mujhse tere siwa koi nahin pherta. Hazir [tere hukm par], khushbakhti [teri madad se]; sari bhalai tere hath mein hai; burai teri [taraf mansoob] nahin. Main tere [fazl] se hun aur teri [taraf] hun; Tu babarkat aur buland hai; Tujhse maghfirat chahta hun aur teri taraf tauba karta hun."
"38","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Jibrail, Mikail aur Israfil ke Rab; aasmanon aur zameen ke paida karne wale; ghaib aur hazir ke janne wale! Apne bandon ke darmiyan jin baaton mein woh ikhtilaf karte the Tu hi faisla karta hai; jin baaton mein ikhtilaf hua un mein apni ijazat se mujhe haqq ki hidayat de; beshak Tu jise chahta hai seedhe raste ki hidayat deta hai."
"39","[AI-translation] Allah sab se bada hai, bahut bada [teen bar]; Allah ke liye bahut zyada tareef [teen bar]; subah-sham Allah ki paki bayan karta hun. Shaitane-rajeem se—us ki phunk, thuk aur waswase se—Allah ki panah chahta hun. [Namaz ke shuru mein teen bar padhe]"
"40","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tareef teri hi hai; Tu hi aasmanon aur zameen aur un mein jo hai us ka nur hai; tareef teri hi hai; Tu hi aasmanon aur zameen aur un mein jo hai use qayam rakhne wala hai; tareef teri hi hai; Tu hi aasmanon aur zameen aur un mein jo hai us ka Rab hai; tareef teri hi hai; aasmanon aur zameen aur un mein jo hai ki badshahat teri hi hai; tareef teri hi hai; Tu hi aasmanon aur zameen ka Badshah hai; tareef teri hi hai; Tu hi Haqq hai, tera wada haqq hai, tera qaul haqq hai, Tujhse mulaqat haqq hai, jannat haqq hai, jahannam haqq hai, nabi haqq hain aur Muhammad haqq hain. Ae Allah! Tere supurd hua, Tujh par bharosa kiya, Tujh par iman laya, teri taraf ruju kiya, tere [deen] ke liye dushmani ki, Tujhe hakim mana; main ne jo kiya aur jo muakhkhar kiya, jo chhipaya aur jo zahir kiya [woh] bakhsh de; Tu hi muqaddam karne wala hai, Tu hi muakhkhar karne wala hai; tere siwa koi mabud nahin. [Tahajjud ki shuruati dua]"
